### Get Image by ID
GET https://localhost:7053/api/biller/image/1

### Get all Images
GET https://localhost:7053/api/biller/image

### Lookup Images
GET https://localhost:7053/api/biller/image/lookup

### Create Image
POST https://localhost:7053/api/biller/image
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ID": 0,
  "TenantID": 0,
  "Url": "Sample",
  "Caption": "Sample",
  "Public": "Sample",
  "Tenant": "Sample"
}

### Update Image
PUT https://localhost:7053/api/biller/image
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ID": 0,
  "TenantID": 0,
  "Url": "Sample",
  "Caption": "Sample",
  "Public": "Sample",
  "Tenant": "Sample"
}

### Delete Image
DELETE https://localhost:7053/api/biller/image/1
